hu-076-wangshu-family:line024","quote":"子晞之嗣。卒，子肇之嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line024:m0008","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line024:m0001"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-w076-xi-yun","subject_person_id":"a04_d8f_416_A","object_person_id":"a04_d8f_416","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子晞之嗣"},"context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line022","c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line024"],"parent_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line022:m0005","child_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line024:m0001","rationale":"依固定版本前傳末及下段首子名，間隔僅一空行。"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-wangshu-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line022","quote":"舒為荊州，允之隨在西府。及敦平，帝欲令允之仕，舒請曰：「臣子尚少，不樂早官。」帝許隨舒之會稽。及蘇峻反，允之討賊有功，封番禺縣侯，邑千六百戶，除建武將軍、錢唐令，領司鹽都尉。舒卒，去職。既葬，除義興太守，以憂哀不拜，從伯導與其書曰：「太保、安豐侯以孝聞天下，不得辭司隸；和長輿海內名士，不免作中書令。吾群從死亡略盡，子弟零落，遇汝如親，如其不爾，吾復何言！」允之固不肯就。咸和末，除宣城內史、監揚州江西四郡事、建武將軍，鎮於湖。咸康中，進號西中郎將、假節。尋遷南中郎將、江州刺史。蒞政甚有威惠。時王恬服闋，除豫章郡。允之聞之驚愕，以為恬丞相子，應被優遇，不可出為遠郡，乃求自解州，欲與庾冰言之。冰聞甚愧，即以恬為吳郡，而以允之為衛將軍、會稽內史。未到，卒，年四十。諡曰忠。","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line022:m0005"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-wangshu-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line024","quote":"子晞之嗣。卒，子肇之嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangshu-family:line024:m0001"}],"interpretation_note":"前段傳主接下段所言之子；原號保留兩段互見。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"fathe